{"id":"n62479-1-13","stage":3,"title":"박사 · 博士","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62479-1-13-1","ko":"승규가 미국에서 돌아왔다며?","zh":"承奎从美国回来啦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"미국에서","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"미국에서","audio":"/audio/e15edc4d4f4a7863f8f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미국에서","audio":"/audio/e15edc4d4f4a7863f8f2.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아왔다며?","meaning":"回，回来，归来","explanation":"돌아오다：回，回来，归来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"돌아오다","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66268","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아왔다며","audio":"/audio/5171bc0fd3ce56e22ad7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cfe0233d2be88a83","term":"돌아오다","zh":"回，回来，归来","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3","entryId":"66268","definition":"返回原地或恢复原状。","pronunciation":["도라오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8e6879b97670984fd1a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62479-1-13-2","ko":"유학 간 게 엊그제 같은데 벌써 박사가 돼서 돌아오다니.","zh":"他去留学好像还是前不久的事，居然已经拿到博士学位回来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学。","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"엊그제","meaning":"几天前，前几天","explanation":"엊그제：几天前，前几天。","readings":[{"term":"엊그제","audio":"/audio/650ca2349df562b7f242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15164","senseId":"1","lemma":"엊그제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엊그제","audio":"/audio/650ca2349df562b7f242.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"박사가","meaning":"博士","explanation":"박사：博士；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"박사","audio":"/audio/4dcefda7022ecdf598b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62479","senseId":"1","lemma":"박사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박사가","audio":"/audio/850753932845ec95dcf4.mp3"}},{"text":"돼서","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼서","audio":"/audio/c6c8c7de6c212f9fe8d1.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아오다니.",